1
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:02,586
<c.simplifiedchinese>&lrm;（诚）</c.simplifiedchinese>

2
00:00:09,853 --> 00:00:14,232
<c.simplifiedchinese>新选组第三小队队长斋藤一</c.simplifiedchinese>

3
00:00:15,656 --> 00:00:16,490
<c.simplifiedchinese>来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

4
00:00:17,618 --> 00:00:19,704
<c.simplifiedchinese>刽子手拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

5
00:00:28,514 --> 00:00:29,474
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

6
00:00:31,020 --> 00:00:32,521
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:00:35,528 --> 00:00:37,363
<c.simplifiedchinese>练习结束了</c.simplifiedchinese>

8
00:00:37,449 --> 00:00:39,451
<c.simplifiedchinese>好了 我们走吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

9
00:00:43,921 --> 00:00:47,007
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你是睡糊涂了吗？
-叫的就是你啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:00:47,093 --> 00:00:48,970
<c.simplifiedchinese>这里除了你还有别人叫剑心吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:00:49,056 --> 00:00:51,099
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 我们快回家吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:00:54,901 --> 00:00:57,904
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:02:28,045 --> 00:02:29,755
<c.simplifiedchinese>新选组？</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:02:29,841 --> 00:02:32,218
<c.simplifiedchinese>你很少睡的这么沉</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:02:32,304 --> 00:02:33,888
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来是梦到以前的事了</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:02:34,474 --> 00:02:38,645
<c.simplifiedchinese>很久没有梦见幕末的事了</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:02:38,733 --> 00:02:44,155
<c.simplifiedchinese>新选组是维新志士的宿敌新选组吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:02:44,871 --> 00:02:48,291
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错 我们交战了许多次</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:02:48,377 --> 00:02:50,546
<c.simplifiedchinese>可谓是最大的宿敌了</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:02:51,885 --> 00:02:52,802
<c.simplifiedchinese>新选组是</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:02:53,429 --> 00:02:56,974
<c.simplifiedchinese>以多摩地区出身的剑客为中心</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:02:57,062 --> 00:02:59,856
<c.simplifiedchinese>替幕府守卫京都的组织</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:03:01,195 --> 00:03:05,449
<c.simplifiedchinese>当时维新志士还在各自行动</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:03:05,536 --> 00:03:09,957
<c.simplifiedchinese>结果京都一时腥风血雨
成为了刀光剑影的魔都</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:03:11,215 --> 00:03:16,011
<c.simplifiedchinese>为了保护京都的治安 他们挥舞刀剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:03:17,727 --> 00:03:20,188
<c.simplifiedchinese>高举着红色的诚字旗</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:03:20,274 --> 00:03:22,652
<c.simplifiedchinese>身穿浅葱色有锯齿花纹的羽织</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:03:22,737 --> 00:03:23,696
<c.simplifiedchinese>&lrm;（诚）</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:03:23,781 --> 00:03:27,493
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为卓越的剑术和不惧死亡的斗志</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:03:27,580 --> 00:03:31,209
<c.simplifiedchinese>震撼了整个京都 被称为壬生狼</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:03:32,090 --> 00:03:36,553
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然他们被近代武器击溃
消失在了时代的洪流中</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:03:36,640 --> 00:03:43,105
<c.simplifiedchinese>但恐怕是日本史上最大最强
也是最后一个剑客集团</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:03:44,531 --> 00:03:51,288
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过我听说新选组
最擅长的是多对一的团体剑法啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:03:51,378 --> 00:03:53,005
<c.simplifiedchinese>总感觉有些卑鄙呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:03:53,591 --> 00:03:57,970
<c.simplifiedchinese>毕竟维持京都的治安
才是他们的第一任务啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:03:58,058 --> 00:04:02,855
<c.simplifiedchinese>自然没法进行普通的一对一决斗了</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:04:03,444 --> 00:04:07,072
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然他们成员个体间还是有实力差距</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:04:07,869 --> 00:04:09,621
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过干部级别的成员</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:04:09,706 --> 00:04:16,004
<c.simplifiedchinese>尤其是参与实战的第一二三小队长
实力更是毋庸置疑</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:04:17,805 --> 00:04:23,228
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下跟他们展开过许多次一对一战斗
结果都是不分胜负</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:04:24,277 --> 00:04:27,405
<c.simplifiedchinese>听说大多数的干部都已经去世了</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:04:27,492 --> 00:04:28,993
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是可惜啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:04:29,788 --> 00:04:32,332
<c.simplifiedchinese>你怎么净说些好话？</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:04:32,418 --> 00:04:33,461
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们不是敌人吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:04:35,508 --> 00:04:36,676
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯…</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:04:37,387 --> 00:04:41,140
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们的确是敌人 不过却没有私怨</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:04:41,770 --> 00:04:43,355
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然站在不同的立场上</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:43,440 --> 00:04:48,112
<c.simplifiedchinese>但都是用自己的剑
赌上性命和信念来战斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:48,909 --> 00:04:50,160
<c.simplifiedchinese>或许</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:50,246 --> 00:04:56,335
<c.simplifiedchinese>比起现在政府中身居要职的维新志士
在下感觉他们才更亲切呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:04:59,556 --> 00:05:01,725
<c.simplifiedchinese>果然听起来很奇怪吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:05:01,810 --> 00:05:04,229
<c.simplifiedchinese>不 不是</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:05:04,316 --> 00:05:09,571
<c.simplifiedchinese>只是剑心会谈到这么多过去的事情
真的很稀奇</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:05:11,622 --> 00:05:13,165
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 我们快走吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:05:15,421 --> 00:05:19,925
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的很久没有梦见那时候的事了</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:05:20,931 --> 00:05:23,601
<c.simplifiedchinese>你傻站着干嘛？剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:05:23,687 --> 00:05:25,105
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们快走吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:05:26,193 --> 00:05:29,071
<c.simplifiedchinese>明明最近完全没有梦到了</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:05:29,741 --> 00:05:31,368
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么刚刚…</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:05:36,463 --> 00:05:40,884
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死 特地过来蹭饭吃的</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:05:40,971 --> 00:05:43,182
<c.simplifiedchinese>这帮家伙到底去哪了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:05:43,268 --> 00:05:44,478
<c.simplifiedchinese>你好</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:05:45,981 --> 00:05:47,191
<c.simplifiedchinese>你谁啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:05:47,777 --> 00:05:50,113
<c.simplifiedchinese>初次见面</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:05:50,199 --> 00:05:55,788
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是多摩来的药商
专卖一种叫做石田散药的灵药</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:05:56,753 --> 00:05:58,922
<c.simplifiedchinese>我叫藤田五郎</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:06:00,261 --> 00:06:01,137
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么样？</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:06:01,221 --> 00:06:05,267
<c.simplifiedchinese>石田散药
对跌打损伤、骨折都很有用…</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:06:05,354 --> 00:06:08,482
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下 我不住这</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:06:08,569 --> 00:06:12,698
<c.simplifiedchinese>主人不在啊 那真是太可惜了</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:06:12,785 --> 00:06:14,704
<c.simplifiedchinese>-喂 你
-什么事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:06:14,789 --> 00:06:18,251
<c.simplifiedchinese>话说你的眼睛真是又窄又长啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:06:19,966 --> 00:06:21,801
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是天生的</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:06:21,887 --> 00:06:23,680
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:06:24,601 --> 00:06:25,518
<c.simplifiedchinese>那…</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:06:27,273 --> 00:06:33,613
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个药商居然会有用刀的人才有的茧
这总不是天生的吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:06:33,702 --> 00:06:36,246
<c.simplifiedchinese>你到底是什么人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:06:39,046 --> 00:06:41,215
<c.simplifiedchinese>还真是敏锐啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:06:41,843 --> 00:06:43,345
<c.simplifiedchinese>相乐左之助</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:06:46,895 --> 00:06:49,898
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊 拔刀斋不在家啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:06:49,984 --> 00:06:53,655
<c.simplifiedchinese>这家伙怎么知道剑心的过去…</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:06:54,243 --> 00:06:55,244
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么…</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:06:57,542 --> 00:06:59,835
<c.simplifiedchinese>我就给他留点礼物吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:07:01,215 --> 00:07:03,384
<c.simplifiedchinese>还藏了这种东西…</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:07:04,179 --> 00:07:07,349
<c.simplifiedchinese>你一开始就是过来找茬的吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:07:08,145 --> 00:07:09,146
<c.simplifiedchinese>好！</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:07:09,231 --> 00:07:10,983
<c.simplifiedchinese>我就来会会你</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:07:11,068 --> 00:07:14,154
<c.simplifiedchinese>用我的拳头问出你真正的身份！</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:07:18,959 --> 00:07:20,377
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:07:20,963 --> 00:07:25,467
<c.simplifiedchinese>传说你是第一打手 你的拳的确不错</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:07:25,556 --> 00:07:26,932
<c.simplifiedchinese>没用吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:07:27,685 --> 00:07:32,273
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过只能适用于明治这个平安年代</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:07:32,361 --> 00:07:35,698
<c.simplifiedchinese>若是在幕末时期的京都 这种拳头</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:07:36,494 --> 00:07:38,038
<c.simplifiedchinese>根本没用</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:07:43,090 --> 00:07:45,885
<c.simplifiedchinese>你怎么走的这么慢 剑心？</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:07:45,971 --> 00:07:48,474
<c.simplifiedchinese>再磨磨蹭蹭的 天就黑了</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:07:49,061 --> 00:07:51,021
<c.simplifiedchinese>感觉你没什么精神</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:07:51,106 --> 00:07:52,983
<c.simplifiedchinese>是不是胃不舒服啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:07:53,069 --> 00:07:56,530
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦 那就轮到我出场了</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:07:56,618 --> 00:07:59,412
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠小姐！你怎么在这？</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:07:59,499 --> 00:08:01,376
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这么吃惊干嘛？</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:08:01,461 --> 00:08:03,713
<c.simplifiedchinese>这里是大街</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:08:03,799 --> 00:08:05,801
<c.simplifiedchinese>我难道不能在这走吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:08:05,886 --> 00:08:07,680
<c.simplifiedchinese>开玩笑的</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:08:07,765 --> 00:08:13,187
<c.simplifiedchinese>其实我今天和明天休息
所以就过来玩了</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:08:13,275 --> 00:08:16,195
<c.simplifiedchinese>绝对不行！狐狸女禁止入内！</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:08:16,281 --> 00:08:20,786
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀 某人受伤的时候是谁治的？</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:08:20,874 --> 00:08:22,501
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且还免费？</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:08:23,295 --> 00:08:26,007
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦 你怎么想？</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:08:26,093 --> 00:08:27,928
<c.simplifiedchinese>晚饭就由我来做</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:08:28,014 --> 00:08:31,183
<c.simplifiedchinese>有什么关系啊 薰？别这么小气啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:08:31,270 --> 00:08:32,646
<c.simplifiedchinese>你个叛徒！</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:08:32,732 --> 00:08:36,068
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 阿剑 我过来玩可以吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:08:39,327 --> 00:08:42,164
<c.simplifiedchinese>感觉你真的没什么精神</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:08:42,250 --> 00:08:44,127
<c.simplifiedchinese>要不我给你看看吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:08:44,212 --> 00:08:48,091
<c.simplifiedchinese>不用 没关系 没什么的</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:08:50,559 --> 00:08:52,603
<c.simplifiedchinese>不能再发愁了</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:08:52,688 --> 00:08:54,982
<c.simplifiedchinese>只会让身边的人担心</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:08:56,111 --> 00:08:58,906
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算突然梦到了过去的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:08:58,992 --> 00:09:01,286
<c.simplifiedchinese>也没必要想太多</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:09:01,873 --> 00:09:03,458
<c.simplifiedchinese>也想不出个结果</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:09:05,964 --> 00:09:08,926
<c.simplifiedchinese>这…怎么回事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:09:12,770 --> 00:09:14,146
<c.simplifiedchinese>血腥味！</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:09:17,278 --> 00:09:18,488
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左！</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:09:29,887 --> 00:09:33,307
<c.simplifiedchinese>来 先喝一杯 藤田</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:09:34,020 --> 00:09:35,772
<c.simplifiedchinese>或者在这里</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:09:35,858 --> 00:09:39,111
<c.simplifiedchinese>叫你斋藤比较好吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:09:39,197 --> 00:09:41,158
<c.simplifiedchinese>您想叫什么都可以</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:09:41,243 --> 00:09:44,246
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有酒就不必了</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:09:44,332 --> 00:09:48,503
<c.simplifiedchinese>真没想到你不喝酒啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:09:48,592 --> 00:09:51,219
<c.simplifiedchinese>不 不是</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:09:52,015 --> 00:09:56,686
<c.simplifiedchinese>只是我一喝了酒 就非常想胡乱杀人</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:10:00,489 --> 00:10:03,367
<c.simplifiedchinese>你还真是可靠啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:10:04,665 --> 00:10:07,460
<c.simplifiedchinese>那我们进入正题吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:10:07,545 --> 00:10:13,134
<c.simplifiedchinese>-绯村拔刀斋现在…
-在一个叫做神谷道场的地方</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:10:13,224 --> 00:10:14,600
<c.simplifiedchinese>我白天去过了</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:10:15,938 --> 00:10:17,814
<c.simplifiedchinese>他不在</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:10:17,900 --> 00:10:21,654
<c.simplifiedchinese>真不愧是前新选组第三小队队长</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:10:21,741 --> 00:10:27,038
<c.simplifiedchinese>听说你要加入我们时
说实话我吃了一惊</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:10:27,126 --> 00:10:31,506
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过果然可以放心把工作交给你啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:10:32,095 --> 00:10:34,472
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也是吃了一惊</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:10:35,101 --> 00:10:37,270
<c.simplifiedchinese>没想到黑笠事件的幕后黑手</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:10:37,355 --> 00:10:43,236
<c.simplifiedchinese>鹈堂刃卫的指使人
竟然是元老院书记涩海先生</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:10:44,077 --> 00:10:48,665
<c.simplifiedchinese>明治政府内部也很复杂的</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:10:48,753 --> 00:10:50,046
<c.simplifiedchinese>的确如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:10:50,716 --> 00:10:54,678
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过这与在维新中落败的我没有关系</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:10:55,349 --> 00:11:00,313
<c.simplifiedchinese>我能把这意外捡来的半条命过得有趣</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:11:00,401 --> 00:11:01,652
<c.simplifiedchinese>就已经足够了</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:11:02,238 --> 00:11:04,866
<c.simplifiedchinese>杀人是我的特长</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:11:04,952 --> 00:11:09,290
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以这是我求之不得的副业</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:11:09,377 --> 00:11:15,300
<c.simplifiedchinese>更何况第一个工作
就是抹杀过去的宿敌</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:11:19,314 --> 00:11:22,150
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过我有一点不解</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:11:22,905 --> 00:11:25,282
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么要特意暗杀一个</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:11:25,367 --> 00:11:27,495
<c.simplifiedchinese>已经下野的浪客？</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:11:28,248 --> 00:11:31,960
<c.simplifiedchinese>这件事的委托人究竟是谁？</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:11:32,048 --> 00:11:34,467
<c.simplifiedchinese>-喂！
-失礼了</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:11:34,552 --> 00:11:36,971
<c.simplifiedchinese>是我多嘴了</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:11:37,058 --> 00:11:39,644
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事 你知道就好</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:11:39,729 --> 00:11:42,649
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 现在不要再提工作的事了</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:11:42,735 --> 00:11:45,279
<c.simplifiedchinese>尽情享受吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:11:45,366 --> 00:11:48,828
<c.simplifiedchinese>不用了 我差不多该回归本职工作了</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:11:48,915 --> 00:11:50,625
<c.simplifiedchinese>否则别人要起疑心了</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:11:55,052 --> 00:11:58,430
<c.simplifiedchinese>那本官就告辞了</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:12:03,987 --> 00:12:08,658
<c.simplifiedchinese>前新选组第三小队队长 斋藤一</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:12:08,745 --> 00:12:11,665
<c.simplifiedchinese>维新后改名为藤田五郎</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:12:11,751 --> 00:12:15,005
<c.simplifiedchinese>在西南战争中
作为警视厅拔刀队的一员参战</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:12:15,092 --> 00:12:17,386
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在担任警部补一职</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:12:17,471 --> 00:12:21,225
<c.simplifiedchinese>也有人说 他是比号称新选组最强的</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:12:21,313 --> 00:12:24,733
<c.simplifiedchinese>冲田总司更强的男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:12:25,446 --> 00:12:31,702
<c.simplifiedchinese>刃卫也打不倒的拔刀斋
如果是他的话…</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:12:31,791 --> 00:12:33,585
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不喜欢他</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:12:33,670 --> 00:12:35,839
<c.simplifiedchinese>一副奇怪的笑眯眯的样子</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:12:35,926 --> 00:12:39,304
<c.simplifiedchinese>别那么多偏见 赤末</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:12:39,390 --> 00:12:41,351
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们要好好相处</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:12:42,396 --> 00:12:45,107
<c.simplifiedchinese>抹杀拔刀斋这件事顺利的话</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:12:45,194 --> 00:12:49,406
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们就要彻底摆脱
暗杀重要人物这种脏活了</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:12:49,995 --> 00:12:51,580
<c.simplifiedchinese>有趣的是</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:12:51,665 --> 00:12:55,669
<c.simplifiedchinese>促成这件事的人竟然来自于幕末时期</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:12:55,756 --> 00:12:57,883
<c.simplifiedchinese>严重威胁着我们的新选组</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:12:58,637 --> 00:13:02,599
<c.simplifiedchinese>被称为壬生狼
令人闻风丧胆的新选组</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:13:02,687 --> 00:13:06,357
<c.simplifiedchinese>在明治不过是没牙的丧家犬罢了</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:13:10,869 --> 00:13:13,664
<c.simplifiedchinese>太暗了 我看不清伤口</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:13:13,750 --> 00:13:15,836
<c.simplifiedchinese>蜡烛什么的都行 再照亮一点！</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:13:15,921 --> 00:13:17,047
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:13:31,494 --> 00:13:32,746
<c.simplifiedchinese>难道…</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:13:35,586 --> 00:13:38,005
<c.simplifiedchinese>（三天后）</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:13:42,600 --> 00:13:43,809
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:13:44,854 --> 00:13:46,439
<c.simplifiedchinese>浴室我用完了</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:13:46,524 --> 00:13:50,612
<c.simplifiedchinese>我来照看左之助
你去泡个澡放松一下吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:13:50,699 --> 00:13:52,409
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:13:53,205 --> 00:13:56,500
<c.simplifiedchinese>-他情况怎么样？
-跟之前一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:13:57,129 --> 00:13:59,924
<c.simplifiedchinese>-阿剑还在道场？
-没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:14:00,511 --> 00:14:02,304
<c.simplifiedchinese>还在那里</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:14:02,390 --> 00:14:05,059
<c.simplifiedchinese>表情很可怕地沉思着什么…</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:14:07,108 --> 00:14:11,946
<c.simplifiedchinese>果然不论怎么想都是那家伙做的</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:14:12,535 --> 00:14:15,121
<c.simplifiedchinese>伞下画着一个圆形标志的药箱</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:14:15,207 --> 00:14:19,211
<c.simplifiedchinese>是新选组的密探变装常用的道具</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:14:19,882 --> 00:14:22,301
<c.simplifiedchinese>水平刺出的刀刃</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:14:22,388 --> 00:14:26,225
<c.simplifiedchinese>是新选组的特技平刺突的特征</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:14:27,064 --> 00:14:28,941
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且如此强的破坏力</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:14:29,025 --> 00:14:30,944
<c.simplifiedchinese>在所有队员中</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:14:31,029 --> 00:14:36,034
<c.simplifiedchinese>只有他最擅长的左手平刺突能做到</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:14:37,793 --> 00:14:38,711
<c.simplifiedchinese>也就是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:14:44,807 --> 00:14:45,808
<c.simplifiedchinese>牙突</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:14:54,786 --> 00:14:59,207
<c.simplifiedchinese>新选组第三小队队长斋藤一</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:14:59,295 --> 00:15:02,298
<c.simplifiedchinese>他来了结我们没分出胜负的决斗吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:15:02,384 --> 00:15:05,721
<c.simplifiedchinese>还是有什么其他的目的？</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:15:08,062 --> 00:15:12,274
<c.simplifiedchinese>不论如何 他的剑术完全没有退步</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:15:25,096 --> 00:15:26,722
<c.simplifiedchinese>用着逆刃刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:15:27,309 --> 00:15:29,228
<c.simplifiedchinese>遵守着不杀的誓言</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:15:29,313 --> 00:15:32,191
<c.simplifiedchinese>我能成功击退他吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:15:39,458 --> 00:15:40,877
<c.simplifiedchinese>久等了</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:15:40,961 --> 00:15:44,339
<c.simplifiedchinese>-请慢用吧
-多谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:15:44,927 --> 00:15:47,680
<c.simplifiedchinese>那我开动了</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:15:50,564 --> 00:15:53,442
<c.simplifiedchinese>只吃一碗清汤荞麦面？</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:15:53,528 --> 00:15:57,532
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是随意的午餐啊 是吧 斋藤？</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:15:58,371 --> 00:16:00,957
<c.simplifiedchinese>我很喜欢清汤荞麦面</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:16:01,043 --> 00:16:03,420
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且我现在叫藤田</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:16:04,007 --> 00:16:06,343
<c.simplifiedchinese>你叫赤末 对吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:16:06,429 --> 00:16:08,139
<c.simplifiedchinese>找我有什么事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:16:08,808 --> 00:16:12,395
<c.simplifiedchinese>没什么事 只是看你不爽</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:16:13,944 --> 00:16:19,115
<c.simplifiedchinese>本来这次的活应该归我</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:16:19,204 --> 00:16:23,708
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是涩海听说了你
就把活派给了你这个新来的</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:16:23,797 --> 00:16:26,800
<c.simplifiedchinese>听着 如果你想做就动作快点</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:16:26,886 --> 00:16:29,430
<c.simplifiedchinese>赶紧被杀了才好</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:16:31,938 --> 00:16:33,439
<c.simplifiedchinese>有什么好笑的？</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:16:34,192 --> 00:16:35,318
<c.simplifiedchinese>没什么</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:16:36,154 --> 00:16:37,572
<c.simplifiedchinese>我明白了</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:16:37,658 --> 00:16:42,413
<c.simplifiedchinese>那这次我们一起行动如何？</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:16:42,501 --> 00:16:43,377
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:16:43,461 --> 00:16:48,133
<c.simplifiedchinese>那天我在现场留下了一些线索</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:16:48,220 --> 00:16:52,891
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在拔刀斋
应该已经注意到了我的存在</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:16:53,523 --> 00:16:58,737
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果我送一封信给他 他一定会赴约</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:16:58,825 --> 00:17:01,202
<c.simplifiedchinese>也就是说你负责引他出来</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:17:01,288 --> 00:17:04,041
<c.simplifiedchinese>然后你来干掉他</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:17:04,127 --> 00:17:05,420
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么样？</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:17:08,428 --> 00:17:09,637
<c.simplifiedchinese>不赖</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:17:10,306 --> 00:17:12,058
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我还是不喜欢</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:17:13,438 --> 00:17:17,484
<c.simplifiedchinese>拔刀斋不是你在新选组的宿敌吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:17:17,571 --> 00:17:20,949
<c.simplifiedchinese>你怎么会这么轻易让给我？</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:17:22,163 --> 00:17:25,708
<c.simplifiedchinese>我在涩海面前说他是我的宿敌</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:17:26,296 --> 00:17:28,673
<c.simplifiedchinese>实际上对我来说 怎样都无所谓</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:17:29,302 --> 00:17:30,470
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说过</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:17:31,139 --> 00:17:36,895
<c.simplifiedchinese>我只想把这个
意外多捡来的后半生过得有趣</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:17:36,984 --> 00:17:41,864
<c.simplifiedchinese>与其冒着危险赚上一大笔
不如赚点能实际入手的小钱</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:17:42,579 --> 00:17:45,833
<c.simplifiedchinese>藤田五郎就是这种人啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:17:48,883 --> 00:17:52,804
<c.simplifiedchinese>我喜欢你的话 就照你说的做</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:17:53,643 --> 00:17:56,521
<c.simplifiedchinese>但有一件事你要记住</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:17:57,150 --> 00:18:01,237
<c.simplifiedchinese>组织里最强的人是本大爷</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:18:06,084 --> 00:18:07,419
<c.simplifiedchinese>真不巧</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:18:08,005 --> 00:18:10,924
<c.simplifiedchinese>和井底之蛙争第一</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:18:11,596 --> 00:18:14,182
<c.simplifiedchinese>我没兴趣</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:18:20,029 --> 00:18:21,447
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:18:21,532 --> 00:18:24,327
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰让你去买点豆腐</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:18:24,914 --> 00:18:29,418
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起 弥彦
在下接下来有点事要做</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:18:30,007 --> 00:18:34,220
<c.simplifiedchinese>可能会晚点回来 你一定要锁好门啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:18:38,524 --> 00:18:40,652
<c.simplifiedchinese>那…豆腐…</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:18:45,622 --> 00:18:46,873
<c.simplifiedchinese>斋藤</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:18:46,958 --> 00:18:49,210
<c.simplifiedchinese>别装模做样了 快出来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:18:53,512 --> 00:18:55,722
<c.simplifiedchinese>轻松避开了我的锁链</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:18:55,809 --> 00:18:58,478
<c.simplifiedchinese>不愧是拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:18:59,440 --> 00:19:01,693
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是什么人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:19:02,321 --> 00:19:07,159
<c.simplifiedchinese>赤末有人 取你性命之人</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:19:07,958 --> 00:19:11,878
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下被人盯上是常有的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:19:12,550 --> 00:19:16,470
<c.simplifiedchinese>但并不打算不明不白地轻易交出性命</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:19:16,558 --> 00:19:19,019
<c.simplifiedchinese>首先让在下听听你的理由</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:19:19,105 --> 00:19:21,274
<c.simplifiedchinese>理由…</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:19:21,944 --> 00:19:23,612
<c.simplifiedchinese>别担心</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:19:23,698 --> 00:19:26,659
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会在你的坟前好好告诉你的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:19:26,746 --> 00:19:29,999
<c.simplifiedchinese>我看见了…你在左边 拔刀…</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:19:31,004 --> 00:19:32,589
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说你看见了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:19:33,216 --> 00:19:35,802
<c.simplifiedchinese>看见的是在下的残影吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:19:36,389 --> 00:19:39,267
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下的动作根本就不算快</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:19:49,082 --> 00:19:50,666
<c.simplifiedchinese>老实投降吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:19:50,752 --> 00:19:53,380
<c.simplifiedchinese>你打不倒在下的</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:19:56,471 --> 00:19:59,432
<c.simplifiedchinese>快回答 你是什么人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:20:00,270 --> 00:20:02,940
<c.simplifiedchinese>你跟斋藤有什么关系？</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:20:06,074 --> 00:20:08,034
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起 我错了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:20:08,120 --> 00:20:10,038
<c.simplifiedchinese>饶了我吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:20:10,124 --> 00:20:12,876
<c.simplifiedchinese>我本来也不想做的</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:20:13,463 --> 00:20:17,092
<c.simplifiedchinese>是斋藤那家伙逼我…</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:20:17,889 --> 00:20:19,599
<c.simplifiedchinese>只是个杂鱼啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:20:20,394 --> 00:20:21,979
<c.simplifiedchinese>派一个这么弱的…</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:20:22,064 --> 00:20:25,860
<c.simplifiedchinese>斋藤那家伙到底在想什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:20:26,448 --> 00:20:29,826
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的话不能全信</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:20:29,913 --> 00:20:32,207
<c.simplifiedchinese>但你今后就金盆洗手吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:20:32,961 --> 00:20:33,920
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:20:34,005 --> 00:20:36,924
<c.simplifiedchinese>你以为我真的放弃了？蠢货！</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:20:39,933 --> 00:20:44,855
<c.simplifiedchinese>瞬间用右手护住脖子
这个动作的确很利落</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:20:44,943 --> 00:20:46,320
<c.simplifiedchinese>但接下来怎么办？</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:20:46,404 --> 00:20:49,407
<c.simplifiedchinese>你双手都被缠住了</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:20:49,494 --> 00:20:52,079
<c.simplifiedchinese>根本动不了</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:21:03,522 --> 00:21:04,981
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心那家伙…</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:21:05,067 --> 00:21:08,487
<c.simplifiedchinese>到底有什么事要做啊？真是的</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:22:47,604 --> 00:22:50,441
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一集 《露出獠牙的狼》</c.simplifiedchinese>

